---
import MascotMark from '../shell/MascotMark.astro';
---

<section class="surface flex min-h-64 flex-col items-center justify-center px-5 py-10 text-center" aria-labelledby="foundation-heading">
  <div class="scale-150" aria-hidden="true"><MascotMark /></div>
  <h2 id="foundation-heading" class="mt-5 text-lg font-extrabold">The feed is not pretending to be busy.</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-ink-muted">
    Phase 1A establishes the shell only. Real persisted posts and interactions belong to later phases.
  </p>
</section>
